cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Awesome Magento AEO
message: >-
  If you reference this list, please cite it using these metadata.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: angeo.dev
    website: https://angeo.dev
repository-code: https://github.com/angeo-dev/awesome-magento-aeo
url: https://github.com/angeo-dev/awesome-magento-aeo
abstract: >-
  A curated list of modules, specifications and tools that make a Magento 2 or
  Adobe Commerce store discoverable, readable and transactable by AI systems.
  Covers llms.txt generation, AI crawler policy, structured data, ACP product
  feeds, agentic checkout, MCP servers and AEO auditing.
keywords:
  - magento
  - magento2
  - adobe-commerce
  - aeo
  - answer-engine-optimization
  - generative-engine-optimization
  - ai-search
  - llms-txt
  - agentic-commerce
  - model-context-protocol
  - structured-data
  - awesome-list
